  "worked_solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -3 & 10 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 7 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}10 & 4 \\\\ 7 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 4 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-3 & 10 \\\\ 4 & 7\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(10\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 7)i-((-3)\\cdot 1-4\\cdot 4)j+((-3)\\cdot 7-10\\cdot 4)k \\\\  & =(10-28)i-(-3-16)j+(-21-40)k \\\\  & =-18i+19j-61k \\\\  & =\u27e8-18,19,-61\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
